# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored - never commit real values.
#
# The Odds API - the project's live price source.
# Free key (500 credits/month) at https://the-odds-api.com/ - email only, no
# betting account needed. It redistributes exchange prices (Betfair Exchange,
# Smarkets, Matchbook) alongside conventional bookmakers, so the model is fed
# genuine exchange odds without a bookmaker margin.
#
# A weekly refresh costs 2 credits, so the free tier is ample.
ODDS_API_KEY=

# --- Your FPL team (optional) ---------------------------------------------
# Your manager id, from the URL when you view your team:
#     fantasy.premierleague.com/entry/ 1234567 /event/4
#                                      ^^^^^^^
# Not a secret - the endpoint is public - but it lives here so your personal
# setup does not get committed with the notebooks.
FPL_TEAM_ID=
